# 4_fluorophenol.msf
# 4-Fluorophenol (para-fluorophenol)
# pKa=9.890
# Source: Perrin 1981 / NIST
# Halogenated phenol: F is electron-withdrawing (inductive) but
# electron-donating (mesomeric). pKa lies between phenol (9.99)
# and 4-chlorophenol (9.38). Tests the fluorine electronic effect
# on the phenol Δq_O and ΔE_CPCM descriptors.

